  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/docs2/). VERDICT: CURRENT. 2026-11-01 review on dev 100b6fbb6e: docs/hypergumbo-spec.md:1400 still defines total_files as sum(profile.languages[L].files), :1403 says unique_paths_in_analysis under-counts relative to total_files, :1407 keeps the no-profile fallback sentence. metrics.py:127 sets total_files = unique_paths unconditionally; schema.json:156 says 'Node-distinct path count (INV-mozaf)'. Premise holds unchanged. MECHANISM: spec prose not updated when INV-mozaf redefined total_files in metrics.py and schema.json."  # 5c6b
